# Soul-Shackled Zombie: "exile up to two target cards from a single graveyard. If at least one creature card was exiled this way, each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life" (CR 701.13, 608.2c). Bot1 kills Bot2's Memnite and Ornithopter with two Cut Downs, then exiles both with the Zombie: two creature cards, but the life changes once (2, not 4). The second target can't come from Bot1's own graveyard (the refusal): all targets lie in a single graveyard (CR 115.1, 601.2c).

